---
// Tech Stack & Diferenciadores de Ingeniería
---

<section class="stack-section" id="stack">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head gs-reveal-up">
      <div class="badge-label">Stack & Diferenciadores</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tecnología moderna para resultados medibles</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Seleccionamos la arquitectura tecnológica precisa según los objetivos de tu empresa. Cero código inflado, máxima velocidad y escalabilidad garantizada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-layout gs-reveal-up">
      <!-- Columna Izquierda: Ecosistema Tecnológico por Categorías -->
      <div class="stack-cats">
        <div class="scat-card">
          <div class="scat-header">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
            <h4 class="scat-title">Frontend & Experiencia</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">Astro</span>
            <span class="sbadge">React</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Next.js 15</span>
            <span class="sbadge">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Tailwind CSS</span>
            <span class="sbadge">GSAP Motion</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="scat-card">
          <div class="scat-header">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"/><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"/><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"/><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"/><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"/><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"/><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"/><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"/></svg>
            <h4 class="scat-title">Backend & APIs</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">Node.js</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Python</span>
            <span class="sbadge">FastAPI</span>
            <span class="sbadge">REST & GraphQL</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Microservicios</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="scat-card">
          <div class="scat-header">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/></svg>
            <h4 class="scat-title">Base de Datos & Cloud</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Supabase</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Redis</span>
            <span class="sbadge">AWS</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Cloudflare</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Docker</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="scat-card">
          <div class="scat-header">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"/></svg>
            <h4 class="scat-title">E-commerce & Conversión</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">Shopify</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Stripe</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Mercado Pago</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Izipay / Niubiz</span>
            <span class="sbadge">Figma UI/UX</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Diferenciadores Clave Monni -->
      <div class="guarantees">
        <div class="gcard">
          <div class="gcard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="gcard-body">
            <h4 class="gcard-title">Arquitectura Limpia & Escalable</h4>
            <p class="gcard-desc">
              Código modular, semántico y testeado que resiste el crecimiento de tu empresa sin necesidad de rehacer la web desde cero al año siguiente.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gcard">
          <div class="gcard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="gcard-body">
            <h4 class="gcard-title">Carga Ultrarrápida & SEO Nativo</h4>
            <p class="gcard-desc">
              Optimizamos los Core Web Vitals para lograr tiempos de carga inferiores a 1 segundo y puntuaciones superiores a 95 en Google PageSpeed.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gcard">
          <div class="gcard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="gcard-body">
            <h4 class="gcard-title">Independencia & Propiedad Total</h4>
            <p class="gcard-desc">
              Sin dependencias frágiles ni mensualidades forzosas de "alquiler". Todo el repositorio, diseño y credenciales son 100% propiedad de tu negocio.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
